---

---

<div class="widget package-inclusions" data-widget="package-inclusions">
    <div class="top">
        <h2>Inclusions</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="icons-listing">
        <div class="item">
            <span class="icon fa-light fa-anchor"></span>
            <p>5 nights in a <strong>Beachfront Studio</strong> located on ground level, with a private balcony or patio at
                3-star Moana Sands Lagoon Resort.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
            <span class="icon fal fa-utensils"></span>
            <p>5 nights in an <strong>intimate Beachfront Bungalow</strong> boasting an additional outside garden shower with
                <strong>private access directly from the beach</strong> at 3-star Tamanu Beach Resort.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
            <span class="icon fal fa-clock"></span>
            <p><strong>Fresh Flower Ei Meet and Greet</strong> on arrival.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
            <span class="icon fa-light fa-circle-dollar"></span>
            <p><strong>Aluminum water bottle</strong> for keepsave - eliminate plastic on the islands.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
            <span class="icon fal fa-binoculars"></span>
            <p>Cruise to 3 fantastic, remote islets and stop for <strong>snorkelling where you can feed tropical fish and see
                giant clams</strong> during the Lagoon Cruise on The Vaka, with BBQ lunch and transfers.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="widget package-accordion" data-widget="package-accordion">
        <!-- OPTIONAL -->
        <!-- <div class="top">
          <h2>Example heading</h2>
          <div class="expand">
            <a href="#" class="expander button ui primary transparent down">Expand All</a>
          </div>
        </div> -->
        <!-- END OPTIONAL -->

        <div class="ui styled fluid accordion">

            <div class="title" data-step="roomOptions">
                <h3 class="heading">Entire Bonus</h3>
                <i class="dropdown icon"></i>
            </div>

            <div class="content accordion-content">
                <div class="inner-content">

                    <div class="icons-listing">
                        <div class="item">
                            <span class="icon fal fa-bus"></span>
                            <p>Special discounted room rates included</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="item">
                            <span class="icon fal fa-user-alt"></span>
                            <p>Complimentary kayaks, stand-up paddleboards, and outrigger canoes in Moorea</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="item">
                            <span class="icon fal fa-binoculars"></span>
                            <p>FREE WiFi included in Tahiti and Moorea</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="title">
                <h3 class="heading">Freedom of Choice</h3>
                <i class="dropdown icon"></i>
            </div>

            <div class="content accordion-content freedom-of-choice">
                <div class="inner-content">
                    <div class="logo">
                        <img src="/images/foc.png"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="copy">
                        <p>Our Freedom of Choice program offers flexibility by allowing you to choose from different options on
                            pre-selected days.</p>
                        <p>Our per person price includes one tour on each Freedom of Choice day as follows:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>One "Freedom of Choice" tour on day 3</li>
                            <li>One "Freedom of Choice" tour on day 5</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Expand the itinerary below for more details.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="title" data-step="roomOptions">
                <h3 class="heading">Package Upgrades</h3>
                <i class="dropdown icon"></i>
            </div>

            <div class="content accordion-content">
                <div class="inner-content">

                    <div class="icons-listing">
                        <div class="item">
                            <span class="icon fal fa-bed"></span>
                            <p>Upgrade to <strong>5-Star accommodation!</strong> Our <a href="#page">Love Positano 5-Star package</a>
                                <strong>from AUD3,569</strong> per person, twin share.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</div>
